   "voz": "¿Podrías pagar un imprevisto mañana mismo, sin pedir prestado?",
   "html": "<div style=\"width:840px\"><div class=\"k\" data-in=\"0\">Fondo de emergencia</div><h1 data-in=\"0\" data-d=\"0.4\">¿Podrías pagar un imprevisto <span class=\"g\">mañana</span>?</h1><p data-in=\"0.3\">Sin pedir prestado ni tirar de tarjeta.</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 840 400\" width=\"840\" style=\"margin-top:60px\"><path d=\"M420,40 C300,40 210,120 200,220 L640,220 C630,120 540,40 420,40 Z\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.4\" data-a=\"pop\"/><line x1=\"420\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"350\" stroke=\"#F5F5F2\" stroke-width=\"10\" data-in=\"0.7\" data-a=\"fade\"/><path d=\"M420,350 C420,385 380,385 378,355\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F5F5F2\" stroke-width=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" data-in=\"0.8\" data-a=\"fade\"/><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#6F6F6F\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" data-in=\"1.0\" data-a=\"fade\"/><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#6F6F6F\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" data-in=\"1.0\" data-a=\"fade\"/><line x1=\"610\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"590\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#6F6F6F\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" data-in=\"1.0\" data-a=\"fade\"/><line x1=\"730\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#6F6F6F\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" data-in=\"1.0\" data-a=\"fade\"/></svg></div>"
