   "dur": 3.0,
   "voz": "Según el INE, el treinta y seis coma cuatro por ciento de la población no puede afrontar un gasto imprevisto. Más de uno de cada tres.",
   "html": "<div style=\"width:840px\"><div class=\"k\" data-in=\"0.1\">El dato</div><h2 data-in=\"0.2\">Más de <span class=\"g\">1 de cada 3</span> no puede.</h2><svg viewBox=\"0 0 840 420\" width=\"840\" style=\"margin-top:70px\"><g transform=\"translate(0,0)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.500\" data-a=\"pop\"/><rect x=\"42\" y=\"0\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.508\" data-a=\"pop\"/><rect x=\"84\" y=\"0\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.516\" data-a=\"pop\"/><rect x=\"126\" y=\"0\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.524\" data-a=\"pop\"/><rect x=\"168\" y=\"0\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.532\" data-a=\"pop\"/><rect x=\"210\" y=\"0\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.540\" data-a=\"pop\"/><rect x=\"252\" y=\"0\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.548\" data-a=\"pop\"/><rect x=\"294\" y=\"0\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.556\" data-a=\"pop\"/><rect x=\"336\" y=\"0\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.564\" data-a=\"pop\"/><rect x=\"378\" y=\"0\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.572\" data-a=\"pop\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"42\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.580\" data-a=\"pop\"/><rect x=\"42\" y=\"42\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.588\" data-a=\"pop\"/><rect x=\"84\" y=\"42\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.596\" data-a=\"pop\"/><rect x=\"126\" y=\"42\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.604\" data-a=\"pop\"/><rect x=\"168\" y=\"42\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.612\" data-a=\"pop\"/><rect x=\"210\" y=\"42\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#F4C54