  {
   "dur": 3.0,
   "voz": "Para eso existe el fondo de emergencia. Dinero apartado solo para imprevistos. Una avería, el dentista, una temporada sin ingresos.",
   "html": "<div style=\"width:840px\"><div class=\"k\" data-in=\"0.1\">Qué es</div><h2 data-in=\"0.2\">Dinero apartado <span class=\"g\">solo</span> para imprevistos.</h2><svg viewBox=\"0 0 840 430\" width=\"840\" style=\"margin-top:70px\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"840\" height=\"125\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"4\" data-in=\"0.5\" data-a=\"fade\"/><circle cx=\"65\" cy=\"62\" r=\"26\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.55\" data-a=\"pop\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"58\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"42\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"0.6\" data-a=\"fade\">Una avería</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"0.6\" data-a=\"fade\">coche, móvil, portátil</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"150\" width=\"840\" height=\"125\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"4\" data-in=\"0.8\" data-a=\"fade\"/><circle cx=\"65\" cy=\"212\" r=\"26\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.8500000000000001\" data-a=\"pop\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"208\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"42\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"0.8999999999999999\" data-a=\"fade\">Salud</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"250\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"0.8999999999999999\" data-a=\"fade\">dentista, gafas</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"300\" width=\"840\" height=\"125\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"4\" data-in=\"1.1\" data-a=\"fade\"/><circle cx=\"65\" cy=\"362\" r=\"26\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"1.15\" data-a=\"pop\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"358\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"42\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"1.2\" data-a=\"fade\">Sin ingresos</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"400\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"1.2\" data-a=\"fade\">un tiempo sin trabajo</text></svg></div>"
  },
  {
   "dur": 3.0,
   "voz": "¿Cuánto? La referencia habitual es de tres a seis meses de gastos fijos. Ojo, de gastos, no de sueldo.",
   "html": "<div style=\"width:840px\"><div class=\"k\" data-in=\"0.1\">Cuánto</div><h2 data-in=\"0.2\">La referencia habitual:</h2><svg viewBox=\"0 0 840 420\" width=\"840\" style=\"margin-top:70px\"><text x=\"420\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#F4C542\" font-size=\"150\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"0.5\" data-a=\"pop\">3-6 meses</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"260\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"48\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"0.9\" data-a=\"fade\">de gastos fijos</text><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"330\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"330\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"420\" y=\"395\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"40\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.3\" data-a=\"fade\">no de sueldo</text></svg><div class=\"src\" data-in=\"1.6\" data-a=\"fade\">Es una orientación, no una regla: con ingresos variables o contrato temporal suele tener sentido apuntar más alto.</div></div>"
  },
  {
   "dur": 3.0,
   "voz": "Si tus gastos fijos son mil cien euros al mes, la meta va de tres mil trescientos a seis mil seiscientos euros.",
   "html": "<div style=\"width:840px\"><div class=\"k\" data-in=\"0.1\">El ejemplo</div><h2 data-in=\"0.2\">Gastos fijos: <span class=\"g\">1.100&nbsp;€</span> al mes.</h2><svg viewBox=\"0 0 840 450\" width=\"840\" style=\"margin-top:70px\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"380\" x2=\"840\" y2=\"380\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"330\" width=\"180\" height=\"50\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#6F6F6F\" data-in=\"0.5\" data-d=\"0.6\" data-a=\"growy\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"310\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"44\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.0\" data-a=\"fade\">1.100 €</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"430\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"34\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"0.5\" data-a=\"fade\">1 mes</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"230\" width=\"180\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.8\" data-d=\"0.6\" data-a=\"growy\"/><text x=\"420\" y=\"210\" fill=\"#F4C542\" font-size=\"44\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.3\" data-a=\"fade\">3.300 €</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"430\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"34\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"0.8\" data-a=\"fade\">3 meses</text><rect x=\"600\" y=\"80\" width=\"180\" height=\"300\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#6F6F6F\" data-in=\"1.1\" data-d=\"0.6\" data-a=\"growy\"/><text x=\"690\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"44\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.6\" data-a=\"fade\">6.600 €</text><text x=\"690\" y=\"430\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"34\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.1\" data-a=\"fade\">6 meses</text></svg><div class=\"src\" data-in=\"1.6\" data-a=\"fade\">Ejemplo ilustrativo. Calcula el tuyo con lo que pagas sí o sí cada mes: alquiler, facturas, comida, transporte.</div></div>"
  },
  {
   "dur": 3.0,
   "voz": "¿Te parece mucho? Con ciento cincuenta euros al mes, llegas a la primera meta en veintidós meses. Y un solo mes de gastos ya te da aire.",
   "html": "<div style=\"width:840px\"><div class=\"k\" data-in=\"0.1\">Paso a paso</div><h2 data-in=\"0.2\"><span class=\"g\">150&nbsp;€</span> al mes, 22 meses.</h2><svg viewBox=\"0 0 840 450\" width=\"840\" style=\"margin-top:70px\"><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"380\" x2=\"800\" y2=\"380\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"800\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#6F6F6F\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"12 10\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"40\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"0.4\" data-a=\"fade\">Meta: 3.300 €</text><path d=\"M40,380 L74,365 L108,351 L142,336 L176,322 L210,307 L244,293 L278,278 L312,264 L346,249 L380,235 L414,220 L448,205 L482,191 L516,176 L550,162 L584,147 L618,133 L652,118 L686,104 L720,89 L754,75 L788,60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F4C542\" stroke-width=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" data-in=\"0.5\" data-d=\"1.2\" data-a=\"draw\"/><circle cx=\"788\" cy=\"60\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"1.7\" data-a=\"pop\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"430\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"0.5\" data-a=\"fade\">Mes 0</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"430\" fill=\"#F4C542\" font-size=\"34\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"end\" data-in=\"1.6\" data-a=\"fade\">Mes 22</text></svg><div class=\"src\" data-in=\"1.6\" data-a=\"fade\">Cálculo propio: 150 € × 22 meses = 3.300 €, sin intereses.</div></div>"
  },
  {
   "dur": 3.0,
   "voz": "¿Dónde guardarlo? Separado, disponible y sin riesgo. No es dinero para invertir.",
   "html": "<div style=\"width:840px\"><div class=\"k\" data-in=\"0.1\">Dónde</div><h2 data-in=\"0.2\">Que cumpla <span class=\"g\">tres cosas</span>.</h2><svg viewBox=\"0 0 840 400\" width=\"840\" style=\"margin-top:70px\"><path d=\"M10,50 L35,75 L80,25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F4C542\" stroke-width=\"12\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-in=\"0.5\" data-d=\"0.4\" data-a=\"draw\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"55\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"46\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"0.55\" data-a=\"fade\">Separado</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"0.6\" data-a=\"fade\">en otra cuenta, fuera de la vista</text><path d=\"M10,190 L35,215 L80,165\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F4C542\" stroke-width=\"12\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-in=\"0.85\" data-d=\"0.4\" data-a=\"draw\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"195\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"46\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"0.9\" data-a=\"fade\">Disponible</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"238\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"0.95\" data-a=\"fade\">lo puedes sacar cuando lo necesites</text><path d=\"M10,330 L35,355 L80,305\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F4C542\" stroke-width=\"12\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-in=\"1.2\" data-d=\"0.4\" data-a=\"draw\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"335\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"46\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"1.25\" data-a=\"fade\">Sin riesgo</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"378\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"1.2999999999999998\" data-a=\"fade\">no es dinero para invertir</text></svg></div>"
  },
  {
   "dur": 3.0,
   "voz": "Primero el colchón, después lo demás. Síguenos para entender tu dinero, sin humo.",
   "html": "<div style=\"width:840px\"><div class=\"k\" data-in=\"0.1\">Conclusión</div><h2 data-in=\"0.2\">Primero el <span class=\"g\">colchón</span>, después lo demás.</h2><p data-in=\"1.0\">Síguenos para entender tu dinero <span class=\"g\">sin humo</span>.</p><div class=\"src\" data-in=\"1.4\" data-a=\"fade\">Datos a 24/11/2026. Contenido informativo, no es asesoramiento financiero.</div></div>"
